; One ledger, several cases. Errors are reported by account, then symbol,
; each at the entry that opened the position still open.
plugin "beancount_options.check_option_expiry"

2026-09-01 open Assets:Broker:Options
2026-09-01 open Assets:Broker:Cash
2026-09-01 open Assets:IRA:Options
2026-09-01 open Assets:IRA:Cash
2026-09-01 open Income:Options

; Partial close: -3 then +1 leaves -2, reported at the opening sale.
2026-09-02 * "Sell to open 3"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -3 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 2.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      6.00 USD

2026-09-10 * "Buy to close 1"
  Assets:Broker:Options   1 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 1.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash     -1.00 USD

; Legs that cancel within one entry: netted, they leave the -2 alone. Leg
; by leg, +2 would reach zero and -2 would reopen it here.
2026-09-15 * "Buy 2 and sell 2 in one entry"
  Assets:Broker:Options   2 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 1.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Options  -2 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 1.00 USD

; Sorted by account, then symbol: root A sorts first though opened last.
2026-09-20 * "Sell to open"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 A261016C00100000 @ 1.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      1.00 USD

; Sign change: -1 then +3 crosses zero, so the +2 left is reported at the
; buy that crossed.
2026-09-03 * "Sell to open"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 TSLA261016C00300000 @ 5.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      5.00 USD

2026-09-12 * "Buy 3, ending long 2"
  Assets:Broker:Options   3 TSLA261016C00300000 @ 5.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash    -15.00 USD

; Same contract in another account is tracked on its own.
2026-09-04 * "Long 100 in the IRA"
  Assets:IRA:Options    100 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 0.50 USD
  Assets:IRA:Cash       -50.00 USD

; Roll: the closed contract is fine; the new one is still before expiry.
2026-09-05 * "Sell to open"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 NVDA261016P00150000 @ 4.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      4.00 USD

2026-10-15 * "Roll out a month"
  Assets:Broker:Options   1 NVDA261016P00150000 @ 1.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 NVDA261120P00150000 @ 3.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      2.00 USD

; Closed after expiry: flat at the end, so nothing is reported.
2026-09-06 * "Sell to open"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 AMD261016P00120000 @ 1.00 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      1.00 USD

2026-10-19 * "Late close"
  Assets:Broker:Options   1 AMD261016P00120000 @ 0.00 USD
  Income:Options

; Moves "today" past the October expiries.
2026-11-01 * "Interest"
  Assets:Broker:Cash      0.10 USD
  Income:Options         -0.10 USD
